    title: "Debian 14 (Forky) 即將發布，徵集社群藝術作品設計，提升使用者體驗",
    summary: "Debian Linux 專案為即將發布的 Debian 14 (代號 Forky) 舉辦社群藝術作品徵集活動。這項活動旨在讓藝術家為新版本提供視覺素材，這些作品將會出現在系統的開機畫面、登入提示和桌面背景等介面元素上。提交截止日期為 11 月 26 日。Debian 沿著其社群驅動的傳統，要求提交的藝術品必須具備「Debian 風格」，能與核心軟體完美整合，且具有長期視覺吸引力。前一個版本 Debian 13 Trixie 的預設主題即為 Elise Couper 的「Ceratopsian」。Debian 團隊提醒，雖然鼓勵藝術家融入趣味元素，但設計不宜過於複雜，以免造成使用者疲勞。Debian 持續定位為「通用作業系統」，其最新點發行版 Trixie 13.7 已於 2026 年 9 月 12 日發布，而 Forky (Debian 14) 目前正處於開發週期的後期階段。",
    tags: ["Debian", "Debian 14", "Forky", "Linux 核心", "社群貢獻", "作業系統"],
    title_en: "Debian 14 (Forky) Nearing Release: Community Artworks Solicited to Enhance User Experience",
    summary_en: "The Debian Linux project is hosting a community art contest for the upcoming Debian 14 (codename Forky). This initiative aims to gather visual assets from artists for the new version, which will appear in interface elements such as the system boot screen, login prompts, and desktop backgrounds. The submission deadline is November 26th. Following its community-driven tradition, Debian requires submitted artwork to possess a 'Debian style,' ensuring seamless integration with the core software and long-term visual appeal. The default theme for the previous version, Debian 13 Trixie, was 'Ceratopsian' by Elise Couper. The Debian team reminds artists that while incorporating fun elements is encouraged, designs should not be overly complex to prevent user fatigue. Debian continues to position itself as a 'general-purpose operating system'; its latest point release, Trixie 13.7, was released on September 12, 2026, and Forky (Debian 14) is currently in the late stages of its development cycle.",
