    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Linux",
    title: "Ubuntu 26.10 將推出 RISC-V 桌面版 ISO，支援 Xubuntu 輕量化桌面環境",
    summary: "Ubuntu 官方宣布，在即將於 10 月 15 日發布的 Ubuntu 26.10 版本中，將首次提供 RISC-V 64 位元的桌面版 ISO 映像檔。目前為止，RISC-V 的 Ubuntu ISO 僅提供伺服器或 CLI 版本，缺乏預先配置的桌面環境。本次更新將提供標準的 Ubuntu Desktop 映像檔，以及一個非官方的 Xubuntu 最小化 ISO，該版本採用了更輕量的 Xfce 桌面環境。這些測試主要針對符合 RVA23 profile 的 SpacemiT K3 硬體進行。文章特別提醒，對於在 QEMU 環境中進行測試的使用者，建議使用 Xubuntu 版本，因為在模擬器上運行 GNOME 桌面環境可能會非常緩慢。此舉顯著提升了 Ubuntu 在 RISC-V 平台上的桌面使用體驗，讓開發者和使用者能更方便地在非傳統架構上部署桌面應用。",
    tags: ["Ubuntu", "RISC-V", "Ubuntu 26.10", "Xubuntu", "桌面環境", "Linux 核心"],
    title_en: "Ubuntu 26.10 to Release RISC-V Desktop ISO Supporting Xubuntu Lightweight Desktop Environment",
    summary_en: "Ubuntu has announced that the upcoming Ubuntu 26.10 release, scheduled for publication on October 15th, will feature the first RISC-V 64-bit desktop ISO image. Previously, RISC-V Ubuntu ISOs only offered server or CLI versions, lacking a pre-configured desktop environment. This update will provide the standard Ubuntu Desktop image, along with an unofficial Xubuntu minimal ISO that utilizes the lighter Xfce desktop environment. These tests are primarily focused on SpacemiT K3 hardware conforming to the RVA23 profile. The article specifically advises users testing in a QEMU environment to use the Xubuntu version, as running the GNOME desktop environment on a simulator can be very slow. This move significantly improves the desktop user experience for Ubuntu on the RISC-V platform, making it easier for developers and users to deploy desktop applications on non-traditional architectures.",
