    category: "Linux",
    title: "AMD PerfOpt 效能優化功能提升舊款 Ryzen APU 性能，適用於 Linux 7.4",
    summary: "AMD 推出了 PerfOpt 效能優化功能，該功能整合在 Linux 7.4 中，並預設啟用於使用 Radeon 整合圖形晶片的系統。此功能允許 AMD IOMMU 繞過 IOMMU，直接存取系統記憶體，從而避免相關的額外開銷。測試結果顯示，即使是舊款的 AMD Ryzen APU/SoC，也能從 PerfOpt 功能中獲得顯著的性能提升。例如，在測試的 ThinkPad P14s Gen 4 筆電上，使用 Ubuntu 26.04 LTS 和最新的 IOMMU 核心建置進行測試，結果證實了 PerfOpt 對於舊世代硬體的性能增益潛力。此優化對於仍使用這類硬體的高階用戶和開發者具有實用價值，建議系統使用者應升級至支援 Linux 7.4 或更高版本的系統，以利用此 IOMMU 性能優化。",
    tags: ["AMD", "PerfOpt", "Linux 7.4", "IOMMU", "Ryzen APU", "Ubuntu"],
    title_en: "AMD PerfOpt Performance Optimization Feature Boosts Older Ryzen APU Performance, Available in Linux 7.4",
    summary_en: "AMD has released the PerfOpt performance optimization feature, which is integrated into Linux 7.4 and is enabled by default on systems utilizing Radeon integrated graphics. This feature allows AMD IOMMU to bypass IOMMU and directly access system memory, thereby avoiding associated overhead. Test results show that even older AMD Ryzen APUs/SoCs can gain significant performance improvements from the PerfOpt feature. For example, testing was conducted on a ThinkPad P14s Gen 4 laptop using Ubuntu 26.04 LTS and the latest IOMMU kernel build, confirming PerfOpt's potential for performance gains on older hardware. This optimization is valuable for advanced users and developers who still use such hardware, and system users are advised to upgrade to a system supporting Linux 7.4 or higher to utilize this IOMMU performance enhancement.",
    tags_en: ["AMD", "PerfOpt", "Linux 7.4", "IOMMU", "Ryzen APU", "Ubuntu"],
