    category: "Linux",
    title: "Ubuntu 26.10 預計預設仍使用 GCC 15，開發者關注 GCC 16 的新功能與支援",
    summary: "本文針對即將發布的 Ubuntu 26.10 版本，指出其預設編譯器版本仍為 GCC 15。作者指出，以往 Ubuntu xx.10 的發行版通常會採用當年最新的主要 GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) 版本作為預設編譯器，例如 Ubuntu 25.10 使用 GCC 15，Ubuntu 24.10 使用 GCC 14。然而，今年 GCC 16 已按時發布，但 Ubuntu 26.10 預設仍維持 GCC 15。雖然 Ubuntu 26.10 提供了 `gcc-16` 套件，但它並非預設編譯器。作者認為，GCC 16 帶來了多項重要改進，包括更佳的錯誤訊息、對 Arm AGI CPU 的支援，以及初步的 AMD Zen 6 (\"znver6\") 支援。由於預設編譯器未更新到最新版本，對於習慣使用 `build-essential` 或其他預設提供套件的開發者來說，這是一個令人失望且意外的變化。目前尚未找到官方關於此變動的公開說明。",
    tags: ["Ubuntu 26.10", "GCC 15", "GCC 16", "build-essential", "Linux", "編譯器"],
    title_en: "Ubuntu 26.10 Expected to Default to GCC 15, Developers Focus on GCC 16 Features and Support",
    summary_en: "This article addresses the upcoming Ubuntu 26.10 release, noting that its default compiler version remains GCC 15. The author points out that previous Ubuntu xx.10 releases typically adopt the latest major GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) version of the year as the default compiler, such as Ubuntu 25.10 using GCC 15, and Ubuntu 24.10 using GCC 14. However, although GCC 16 was released on schedule this year, Ubuntu 26.10 defaults to GCC 15. While Ubuntu 26.10 provides a `gcc-16` package, it is not the default compiler. The author believes that GCC 16 brings several important improvements, including better error messages, support for Arm AGI CPUs, and preliminary support for AMD Zen 6 (\"znver6\"). Because the default compiler has not been updated to the latest version, this is a disappointing and unexpected change for developers who are accustomed to using `build-essential` or other default provided packages. There is currently no official public statement regarding this change.",
    tags_en: ["Ubuntu 26.10", "GCC 15", "GCC 16", "build-essential", "Linux", "Compiler"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Ubuntu-26.10-GCC-15-Default", lang: "EN" }
    ]
