    title: "Qualcomm MSM 驅動程式在 Linux 上新增靜態 HDR 支援，提升 Snapdragon X 筆電顯示功能",
    summary: "針對使用 Qualcomm Snapdragon X 處理器的筆記型電腦在 Linux 環境下的用戶，MSM DRM 核心驅動程式正逐步加入靜態 HDR（High Dynamic Range）支援。此項更新旨在為 DisplayPort 輸出和 eDP 面板提供支援，特別聚焦於 HDR10 和 BT.2020 RGB 信號傳輸。目前這些修補程式尚未提供動態 HDR 或色調映射（tone mapping）功能。這些修補程式已通過在搭載 Snapdragon X1 Elite 的 Lenovo Yoga Slim 7x 筆電上的測試。開發者可透過 dri-devel mailing list 獲取最新的修補程式。此進展顯示了開源 Linux 顯示驅動程式在提升多媒體顯示能力方面的持續發展。",
    tags: ["Qualcomm", "MSM DRM", "Linux", "HDR", "Snapdragon X", "DisplayPort"],
    title_en: "Qualcomm MSM Driver Adds Static HDR Support on Linux, Enhancing Snapdragon X Laptop Display Capabilities",
    summary_en: "For users of laptops equipped with Qualcomm Snapdragon X processors, the MSM DRM kernel driver is gradually incorporating support for Static High Dynamic Range (HDR). This update aims to provide support for DisplayPort output and eDP panels, specifically focusing on HDR10 and BT.2020 RGB signal transmission. Currently, these patches do not yet provide dynamic HDR or tone mapping functionality. These patches have been tested on Lenovo Yoga Slim 7x laptops featuring the Snapdragon X1 Elite. Developers can obtain the latest patches via the dri-devel mailing list. This progress demonstrates the continuous development of open-source Linux display drivers in enhancing multimedia display capabilities.",
