    id: "20261009-15395",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Linux",
    title: "Mesa 26.3 新增 VK_AMD_anti_lag 支援：優化 AMD RADV 驅動的遊戲低延遲體驗",
    summary: "Mesa 26.3 版本為 AMD 的 RADV 驅動整合了 VK_AMD_anti_lag 功能，旨在為 AMD Linux 遊戲玩家提供更優化的低延遲遊戲體驗。VK_AMD_anti_lag 是一個 Vulkan 擴充功能，最初於 2024 年 7 月搭配 Vulkan 1.3.291 推出，其核心功能是透過自動調整 CPU 節奏，確保 CPU 不會過早領先 GPU，從而最小化輸入事件與螢幕更新之間的延遲。先前此功能曾以隱式 Vulkan 層形式進入 Mesa，但 Valve 工程師主導的開發工作已替換為更通用的 \"vk_frame_pacer\" 工具框架。此新框架不僅適用於 Mesa 的多個 Vulkan 驅動，還能為未來整合 NVIDIA 的 VK_NV_low_latency_2 擴充功能打下基礎。該功能已合併至 Mesa 26.3，預計於 11 月穩定發布，顯著提升了 Linux 遊戲的性能與流暢度。",
    tags: ["Mesa 26.3", "VK_AMD_anti_lag", "RADV", "Vulkan", "Linux", "遊戲效能"],
    title_en: "Mesa 26.3 Adds VK_AMD_anti_lag Support: Optimizing Low-Latency Gaming Experience with AMD RADV Drivers",
    summary_en: "The Mesa 26.3 version integrates the VK_AMD_anti_lag feature into AMD's RADV driver, aiming to provide an optimized low-latency gaming experience for AMD Linux gamers. VK_AMD_anti_lag is a Vulkan extension that was initially released in July 2024 alongside Vulkan 1.3.291. Its core function is to automatically adjust CPU pacing, ensuring the CPU does not overly lead the GPU, thereby minimizing the delay between input events and screen updates. Previously, this feature entered Mesa as an implicit Vulkan layer, but the development work, led by Valve engineers, has transitioned to the more general \"vk_frame_pacer\" tool framework. This new framework is not only applicable to multiple Vulkan drivers within Mesa but also lays the groundwork for future integration of NVIDIA's VK_NV_low_latency_2 extension. The feature has been merged into Mesa 26.3 and is expected to be released stably in November, significantly enhancing the performance and fluidity of Linux gaming.",
    tags_en: ["Mesa 26.3", "VK_AMD_anti_lag", "RADV", "Vulkan", "Linux", "Gaming Performance"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/Mesa-26.3-RADV-VK_AMD_anti_lag", lang: "EN" }
    ]
