    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "SonicWall SMA1000 設備面臨新漏洞 CVE-2026-102255 攻擊，遠端未驗證攻擊者可執行未授權操作",
    summary: "資安研究人員發現，SonicWall SMA1000 設備存在一嚴重漏洞 CVE-2026-102255。此漏洞影響 SMA1000 6210、7210 和 8200v 型號的 Appliance WorkPlace 介面，允許遠端未驗證的攻擊者透過惡意的 OPTIONS 請求，利用 CouchDB 服務執行未授權操作。攻擊者可透過該路徑指示設備發出請求，並潛入內部功能。雖然 SonicWall 已發布補丁，但研究機構的蜜罐網路已偵測到與此漏洞一致的攻擊嘗試。由於 SMA1000 設備常被大型企業、MSSP 和政府機構用於 VPN 存取內部網路，因此極易成為攻擊目標。建議用戶應立即修補所有受影響的 SMA1000 設備，並留意是否有其他未公開的攻擊鏈。過去 SonicWall 的設備也曾因其他零日漏洞（如 CVE-2026-15409、CVE-2026-15410）和漏洞組合被用於植入惡意軟體。",
    tags: ["SonicWall", "CVE-2026-102255", "SMA1000", "Appliance WorkPlace", "遠端攻擊", "CouchDB"],
    title_en: "SonicWall SMA1000 Devices Face New Vulnerability CVE-2026-102255 Attack, Allowing Remote Unauthenticated Unauthorized Operations",
    summary_en: "Security researchers have discovered a critical vulnerability, CVE-2026-102255, affecting the SonicWall SMA1000 device. This vulnerability impacts the Appliance WorkPlace interface of SMA1000 models 6210, 7210, and 8200v, allowing unauthenticated remote attackers to execute unauthorized operations by sending malicious OPTIONS requests that exploit the CouchDB service. Attackers can use this path to instruct the device to issue requests, potentially gaining access to internal functions. Although SonicWall has released a patch, a research institution's honeypot network has detected attack attempts consistent with this vulnerability. Given that SMA1000 devices are frequently used by large enterprises, MSSPs, and government agencies for VPN access to internal networks, they are highly susceptible to attack. Users are advised to immediately patch all affected SMA1000 devices and remain vigilant for other potential attack chains. SonicWall devices have previously been exploited due to other zero-day vulnerabilities (such as CVE-2026-15409 and CVE-2026-15410) and vulnerability combinations used for malware implantation.",
    tags_en: ["SonicWall", "CVE-2026-102255", "SMA1000", "Appliance WorkPlace", "Remote Attack", "CouchDB"],
