    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "前瞻技術",
    title: "HPE ProLiant Gen13 伺服器強化安全性：導入PQC、多人核准與首次開機自動加密",
    summary: "處理器大廠AMD發表EPYC 9006 SP7系列處理器，促使多家伺服器廠商如Dell、神雲、華碩、Supermicro等推出新機型。其中，HPE宣布推出搭載iLO 8的ProLiant Gen13系列伺服器，大幅提升安全性。該系列首次在韌體層面提供超越傳統的後量子密碼學（PQC）防護，支援FIPS 204和FIPS 203標準的ML-DSA與ML-KEM，並提供專用CNSA 2.0模式，擴展PQC保護至TLS、SSH及SPDM等通訊機制。此外，Gen13引入多人授權機制（Multi-Party Authorization, MPA），要求重大操作（如金鑰建立、安全抹除）需經兩名或多名人員共同核准，實踐雙重控制。最後，它實現了首次開機自動加密（auto-SED）功能，使伺服器從啟動第一刻起即自動保護靜態儲存資料，無需手動設定。這些強化功能旨在提升伺服器系統的整體資料完整性與抗量子能力。",
    tags: ["HPE", "ProLiant Gen13", "iLO 8", "後量子密碼學", "PQC", "FIPS 204", "CNSA 2.0"],
    title_en: "HPE ProLiant Gen13 Servers Enhance Security with PQC, Multi-Party Authorization, and Auto-SED",
    summary_en: "Processor giant AMD has released the EPYC 9006 SP7 series processors, prompting multiple server vendors such as Dell, Shenyun, Asus, and Supermicro to launch new models. Among these, HPE announced the ProLiant Gen13 series servers equipped with iLO 8, significantly enhancing security. This series provides, for the first time in firmware, advanced post-quantum cryptography (PQC) protection, supporting ML-DSA and ML-KEM compliant with FIPS 204 and FIPS 203 standards, and offering a dedicated CNSA 2.0 mode that extends PQC protection to communication mechanisms like TLS, SSH, and SPDM. Furthermore, Gen13 introduces Multi-Party Authorization (MPA), requiring joint approval from two or more personnel for critical operations (such as key generation or secure erasure), thereby implementing dual control. Finally, it achieves auto-SED (auto-Self-Encrypting Drive) functionality, automatically protecting static storage data from the moment the server starts up, eliminating the need for manual configuration. These enhanced features aim to improve the overall data integrity and quantum resistance of the server system.",
    tags_en: ["HPE", "ProLiant Gen13", "iLO 8", "Post-Quantum Cryptography", "PQC", "FIPS 204", "CNSA 2.0"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/179547", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
