    title: "TrendForce預測 2027 年全球筆電出貨量可能下滑，成本上升與需求疲軟成主要挑戰",
    summary: "根據 TrendForce 的最新報告，全球筆記型電腦（notebook）市場在 2027 年面臨挑戰，預計出貨量將呈現低至高個位數的下降趨勢。市場風險預期將從供應限制轉移至成本上升對需求的衝擊。報告指出，如果 DRAM 和 CPU 等核心組件價格持續高漲，製造商可能被迫將更高的成本轉嫁給消費者，這可能會延長消費者的更換週期，進一步加劇出貨量的下滑。此外，由於部分更換需求已提前至 2026 年，後續的更換動力可能減弱。由於 CPU、DRAM 和 SSD 等組件成本佔主流筆電 BOM 的比例極高，品牌將面臨在提高零售價格、犧牲毛利或降低產品規格之間的艱難取捨。雖然 DRAM 供應預計因 AI 需求保持緊俏，但 NAND Flash 供應限制預計在 2027 年下半年會緩解。最終，品牌必須在定價、規格和獲利能力之間做出取捨，成本轉嫁的程度將是決定市場需求的關鍵因素。",
    tags: ["TrendForce", "筆電市場", "Notebook", "CPU", "DRAM", "供應鏈"],
    title_en: "TrendForce Predicts Global Laptop Shipments May Decline in 2027, Citing Cost Increases and Weak Demand",
    summary_en: "According to the latest report from TrendForce, the global notebook market faces challenges in 2027, with shipments expected to show a downward trend into the low single digits. Market risks are anticipated to shift from supply constraints to the impact of rising costs on demand. The report points out that if core component prices, such as DRAM and CPU, continue to rise, manufacturers may be forced to pass higher costs onto consumers. This could extend consumer replacement cycles, further exacerbating the decline in shipments. Furthermore, since some replacement demand has been pulled forward to 2026, subsequent replacement momentum may weaken. Given that components like CPU, DRAM, and SSD account for a very high proportion of the mainstream laptop BOM, brands face difficult choices between raising retail prices, sacrificing gross margins, or lowering product specifications. Although DRAM supply is expected to remain tight due to AI demand, NAND Flash supply constraints are anticipated to ease in the second half of 2027. Ultimately, brands must make trade-offs between pricing, specifications, and profitability, with the degree of cost pass-through being the key factor determining market demand.",
    tags_en: ["TrendForce", "Laptop Market", "Notebook", "CPU", "DRAM", "Supply Chain"],
