    title: "全球個人電腦出貨量暴跌近兩成，Omdia與IDC數據揭示市場需求疲軟",
    summary: "根據Omdia和IDC兩家分析機構的報告，全球個人電腦（PC）出貨量在2026年第三季度出現大幅下滑。Omdia指出，全球筆電、桌上型電腦和工作站的出貨量年減21.2%，達到5810萬台；桌上型電腦出貨量下降23.5%，筆電出貨量下降20.6%。IDC的數據也顯示，PC出貨量年減20.1%，至6270萬台。分析師指出，此次跌幅尤其值得關注，因為通常第三季的出貨量會高於第二季。專家分析認為，市場需求疲軟的主要原因包括PC廠商和銷售通路在年初為預期記憶體價格上漲而大量囤積庫存，導致第三季度市場需求極度低迷，銷售通路目前正擔憂庫存過剩。",
    tags: ["PC", "Omdia", "IDC", "全球供應鏈", "市場分析", "電子產品"],
    title_en: "Global PC Shipments Plummet Nearly 20%, Omdia and IDC Data Reveal Weak Market Demand",
    summary_en: "According to reports from Omdia and IDC, global personal computer (PC) shipments saw a significant decline in the third quarter of 2026. Omdia noted that shipments of laptops, desktop computers, and workstations fell by 21.2% year-over-year, reaching 58.1 million units; desktop computer shipments dropped by 23.5%, and laptop shipments declined by 20.6%. IDC data also showed a 20.1% year-over-year decrease in PC shipments, totaling 62.7 million units. Analysts pointed out that this decline is particularly noteworthy because third-quarter shipments are typically higher than second-quarter shipments. Experts analyze that the primary cause of the weak market demand includes PC manufacturers and sales channels heavily stocking inventory at the beginning of the year in anticipation of rising memory prices, leading to extremely sluggish market demand in the third quarter, and sales channels are currently concerned about inventory overstocking.",
    tags_en: ["PC", "Omdia", "IDC", "Global Supply Chain", "Market Analysis", "Consumer Electronics"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Ars Technica", url: "https://arstechnica.com/information-technology/2026/10/pc-shipments-fall-20-1-percent-in-sharpest-decline-since-q1-2023", lang: "EN" }
    ]
