    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Python 3.15 版本發布：新增 sentinel 與 frozendict 內建類型，並預設使用 UTF-8 編碼",
    summary: "Python 語言發布了 Version 3.15。本次版本的主要更新包括新增了內建的 `sentinel` 和 `frozendict` 類型。此外，該版本預設採用 UTF-8 編碼，並改善了實驗性的 JIT 編譯器。開發者可以透過查閱「What's new in Python 3.15」文章和完整的變更日誌，了解所有新功能和細節。本次更新主要針對語言層面的特性提升與編碼標準化，對於使用 Python 語言的開發者具有實用價值。",
    tags: ["Python", "Python 3.15", "sentinel", "frozendict", "UTF-8", "JIT compiler"],
    title_en: "Python 3.15 Released: Introduces built-in sentinel and frozendict types, defaults to UTF-8 encoding",
    summary_en: "The Python language has released Version 3.15. Key updates in this version include the addition of built-in `sentinel` and `frozendict` types. Furthermore, the version defaults to UTF-8 encoding and improves the experimental JIT compiler. Developers can learn about all new features and details by checking the \"What's new in Python 3.15\" article and the complete changelog. This update primarily focuses on language-level feature enhancements and encoding standardization, offering practical value to developers using Python.",
    tags_en: ["Python", "Python 3.15", "sentinel", "frozendict", "UTF-8", "JIT compiler"],
