    title: "俄羅斯科技巨頭 Yandex 資料中心遭無人機攻擊停擺，影響雲端服務",
    summary: "俄羅斯網際網路巨頭 Yandex 的雲端服務供應商宣布，其位於 Sasovo 的資料中心因無人機攻擊引發的火災而停擺，影響了 Yandex Cloud 的部分基礎設施。Yandex 服務狀態頁面顯示，其 ru-central1-b 可用性區域已關閉，資料中心營運已完全中止。該公司建議用戶採用「替代服務恢復計畫」，包括使用其裸金屬伺服器，但同時警告用戶短期內無法恢復服務。報導指出，這已是今年第二個因無人機攻擊而損失設施的雲端服務商（另一個案例為 AWS 的巴林設施）。業界專家指出，資料中心作為關鍵基礎設施，在衝突期間極可能成為攻擊目標。Yandex 尚未對無人機攻擊的來源發表評論，但有報導指出，烏克蘭方面認為這是俄羅斯發動的攻擊。",
    tags: ["Yandex", "資料中心", "雲端基礎設施", "無人機攻擊", "關鍵基礎設施", "AWS", "俄羅斯"],
    title_en: "Russian Tech Giant Yandex Data Center Shut Down After Drone Attack, Affecting Cloud Services",
    summary_en: "Cloud service provider Yandex announced that its data center in Sasovo has been shut down following a fire caused by a drone attack, impacting parts of Yandex Cloud's infrastructure. Yandex's service status page indicates that its ru-central1-b availability zone is closed, and data center operations are completely suspended. The company advised users to adopt a 'disaster recovery plan,' including utilizing its bare metal servers, but simultaneously warned users that service restoration would be impossible in the short term. Reports indicate that this is the second cloud service provider this year to lose facilities due to a drone attack (the other case being AWS's Berlin facility). Industry experts point out that data centers, as critical infrastructure, are highly likely to become targets during periods of conflict. Yandex has not commented on the source of the drone attack, but reports suggest that Ukraine considers the attack to be launched by Russia.",
