    title: "AI 時代下的智慧監控：SoC、NPU 晶片技術趨勢與國產化發展分析",
    summary: "隨著智慧監控市場從傳統 CCTV 硬體，快速轉向「即時 AI 分析」、「邊緣 AI」及「生成式 AI 影像搜尋」等高階應用，市場核心競爭力已轉移至能執行大量運算的影像專用 SoC（System on Chip）和 NPU（Neural Processing Unit）。NPU 是專門加速深度學習運算的關鍵元件，它與 SoC 結合，使邊緣設備（Edge）能夠在單晶片上完成即時的物體識別和異常行為分析。\n\n市場的晶片架構選擇包括：1. 一般影像 SoC（適用於低成本、低功耗的基礎監控）；2. NPU 內建型 SoC（One-Chip AI SoC，適用於邊緣設備，如低功耗、低熱量的智慧攝影機）；3. 高性能外接 NPU 組合（Two-Chip，適用於多通道 NVR 或邊緣 AI 機箱，需執行高複雜度的多重物體追蹤）。\n\n市場成長預測顯示，全球安全影像監控 SoC 晶片市場預計將持續增長。此外，為確保供應鏈安全，韓國政府正積極支援國產化 SoC 開發，目標涵蓋高能效影像處理、SBOM（軟體資產清單）、國家加密體系及抗量子計算（PQC）等整合安全功能，打造具備完整安全體系的單晶片系統，並將其應用於智慧城市和智慧監控領域。",
    tags: ["AI SoC", "NPU", "邊緣 AI", "智慧監控", "SoC 晶片", "國產化"],
    title_en: "Smart Surveillance in the AI Era: Trends and Analysis of SoC and NPU Chip Technologies and Localization Development",
    summary_en: "As the smart surveillance market rapidly shifts from traditional CCTV hardware toward high-end applications such as 'real-time AI analysis,' 'edge AI,' and 'generative AI image search,' the core market competitiveness has moved to specialized image-dedicated SoCs (System on Chip) and NPUs (Neural Processing Unit) capable of executing massive computations. The NPU is a critical component specialized in accelerating deep learning computations. When combined with an SoC, it enables edge devices to perform real-time object identification and anomaly detection on a single chip.\n\nThe chip architecture choices in the market include: 1. General image SoCs (suitable for basic, low-cost, low-power surveillance); 2. NPU-integrated SoCs (One-Chip AI SoCs, suitable for edge devices like low-power, low-heat smart cameras); and 3. High-performance external NPU combinations (Two-Chip, suitable for multi-channel NVRs or edge AI enclosures that require executing high-complexity multi-object tracking).\n\nMarket growth forecasts indicate that the global security image surveillance SoC chip market is expected to continue growing. Furthermore, to ensure supply chain security, the South Korean government is actively supporting the localization development of SoCs. These efforts aim to integrate comprehensive security functions, including high-energy efficiency image processing, SBOM (Software Bill of Materials), national encryption systems, and Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC), to create single-chip systems with complete security architectures, which will then be applied to smart city and smart surveillance domains.",
    tags_en: ["AI SoC", "NPU", "Edge AI", "Smart Surveillance", "SoC Chip", "Localization"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Boannews 韓國", url: "https://boannews.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=146286", lang: "EN" }
    ]
